Package: MkPrimeEcology
Title: Ecology-Biased Equilibrium Model as an 'MkPrime' Extension
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Martin R.", "Smith", email = "martin.smith@durham.ac.uk",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-5660-1727"))
Description: The ecology-biased equilibrium (EBE) model for neomorphic
    morphological characters, in which a tip ecology reconstruction tilts
    the equilibrium of character presence on each edge. Built on the 'MkPrime'
    engine extension interface: 'MkPrime' samples the tree and its own
    parameters, and this package scores the neomorphic characters.
